		"ja": [
			"シンオウ地方で活躍する幻のポケモン「アルセウス」がポケプラセレクトシリーズで登場！",
			"• こだわりのパーツ構成で「色分け」と「組み立てやすさ」を両立。",
			"• 首や脚などの部位に可動箇所を設けることで、ダイナミックなポージングが可能に。",
			"• クリア成形の専用台座が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The mythical Pokemon \"Arceus\" who is active in the Sinnoh region is now available in the PokePla Select Series!",
			"• Achieves both \"color-coding \" and \" ease of assembly\" with carefully selected parts configuration.",
			"• By providing movable parts such as the neck and legs, dynamic poses are possible.",
			"• Comes with a special clear molded pedestal."
		]
	},
